{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e962042129a858dde92809452c37b13105f36a842a1e7785c11a5abf4c60899d", "ja": "（オフということで、瑞希と一緒に買い物に来た。\n服を選ぶのに付き合ってほしいということだが……）", "zh": "（今天休息，所以和瑞希一起来购物了。她说想让我陪她挑衣服，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "8338b0389a46f79fd6abb146672efa0be6e0d830d6548cd7ab0d24187957ce4d", "ja": "ふむふむ。地図によれば、ここが目的のお店です。\nまさに灯台下暗し。……目の前だったぞ。", "zh": "嗯嗯。根据地图显示，这里就是目的地的店。\n真是灯下黑……原来就在眼前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7c90b189fe805604eea978f9194dab1cc3fc23fee4178ce65cd4be798238d33f", "ja": "ここって……おもちゃ屋だな。\n今日は服を選ぶんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "这里……是玩具店吧。\n今天不是要挑衣服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "26bc06d0f02f976fb469a1b5a7662f95aef4ee113885672b1e391cc921702fcb", "ja": "はい。情報によると、ここは品揃えが豊富なようです。\nきっと、リトルミズキに似合う服も見つかるでしょう。", "zh": "是的。听说这里商品种类很丰富。  \n一定能找到适合小瑞希的衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fddd272595dd9a5d41b1d8f04006f0b1d32bd6007baa30092cea49468bdeb336", "ja": "リトルミズキって、たしか瑞希と一緒にいる人形……\nじゃない。小さな瑞希のことだよな？", "zh": "“小瑞希”就是那个一直和瑞希在一起的玩偶……不对，是指小小的瑞希，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "dbd7f35b54f645a00c27e0a31ebe4aa85590863b0bbc84a52d91cd1ea63a35cc", "ja": "あっ。すみません、説明不足でしたね。いつも大活躍\nしている彼女に、服をプレゼントしようと思って。", "zh": "啊。对不起，是我没说明白。我想给一直大显身手的她，送一件衣服当作礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "a8e5473234cc4b8eba7920b6486a3a4d3284e61303ec914dd2449529d719d377", "ja": "私が選ぶと同じものばかりになってしまうので、\n{$P$}の意見を参考にしようかと。", "zh": "因为我自己选的话总会挑到一样的东西，\n所以想参考一下{$P$}的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e9ea12557afe15cb1df82d557c88ec154b7d3c230bc9a96272acdef7f9d4f218", "ja": "そういうことだったのか。わかった、協力するよ！\nそれで、何かイメージはあったりするのか？", "zh": "原来是这样啊。明白了，我会帮忙的！\n那么，你有什么想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "be0657ed3e461ad7299eeaf0e3a9621f8a2111049937c7ad3407fb9c48bd3ffb", "ja": "そうですね……。彼女は、キュートな外見に似合わず、\nなかなかパワフルです。たまにはお淑やかな服も……。", "zh": "是啊……她虽然外表可爱，却相当有活力。偶尔也穿穿端庄的衣服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "05e632dc101f49cc2030813c09bba4495f60f077319ab97499bcae24cda61b80", "ja": "いえ、愛らしさが際立つような服もよく似合うんです。\nどの服も似合うからこそ捨てがたく……困ったぞ。", "zh": "不，凸显可爱感觉的衣服也挺适合她。\n正是因为穿哪件都好看才难以割舍……好伤脑筋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1010_p", "source_sha256": "28d19a01bee2862071f79581603a6cd48765cfe544b583869b9ac6c512a42910", "ja": "（迷って悩む瑞希の姿に、リトルミズキへの愛情を\n感じた。そして、プレゼントの一着を決めた……）", "zh": "（从瑞希犹豫苦恼的样子中，我感受到了她对小瑞希的爱。然后，我选定了一件作为礼物……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "5f5cae775cbce504b707e155af17b869ec383c6feb7d5910a1b3d1f668b2a8b6", "ja": "ありがとうございました、{$P$}。\nおかげで、とてもいいプレゼントが買えました。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n多亏了您，买到了非常棒的礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7928c0db432e968ea764b5bf9dd7675e485adb30ee9fbb4b48adb88cbb10e8f4", "ja": "どういたしまして。\nリトルミズキが気に入ってくれるかどうか……。", "zh": "不客气。也不知道小瑞希会不会喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "01becb61af4d4f70b29490302fa6e89d81aa2e35dc666666e51c05135b93b1ef", "ja": "大丈夫です。間違いなく気に入ると思います。\n私たちが一生懸命、選んだドレスですから。", "zh": "没问题的。我想她一定会喜欢的。\n毕竟这是我们倾尽心意挑选的礼服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "7d03772032f8b8d2811b396dfe5ba522685d8b9c988924724a923dc0bc623232", "ja": "{$P$}に真剣に選んでもらえるなんて\n彼女は幸せ者ですね。ちょっと羨ましいぞ。", "zh": "能让{$P$}这么认真地挑选，\n她可真是幸福呢。有点让人羡慕哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1015_p", "source_sha256": "60822c8b97de731b0c3f9798c66ec99ddf9bd13be944f6e67cefa2c27abeb855", "ja": "ははっ、リトルミズキに焼きもちか。\nでも瑞希の衣装だって、いつも真剣に選んでるぞ？", "zh": "哈哈，吃小瑞希的醋了啊。不过瑞希的服装，我也一直都是认真挑选的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b52241f1ec29a2e8846f4e938803bee2a9b65da5271d04ce85b0ee1191c6325e", "ja": "瑞希に似合うのはどんな衣装か、悩んで決めてるよ。\nまあ、今でも最初に衣装を渡す時は緊張するけどな。", "zh": "我会苦恼该选什么样的服装才适合瑞希，然后再做决定。\n不过直到现在，每次第一次把服装交给她时，我还是会紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "331cf41b2f9df04b66a6a22d1ff0afbca0c131a9a680ce12c96070c12995bc69", "ja": "……{$P$}。\n今日の私と同じですね。……えへへっ。", "zh": "……和我一样呢，{$P$}。\n和今天的我一样呢。……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1018_p", "source_sha256": "71c111d1c75378b144e339b07366a566d6520828035d19143c8bb9bfd9d707fe", "ja": "瑞希？", "zh": "瑞希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "fe8da86203b91a6c5afaacfb3312a1ef5e993bc311b4f655c48f79c31ea933d9", "ja": "ハッ。すみません、私としたことが。\nなんだか私までプレゼントをもらったような気分です。", "zh": "哈。抱歉，竟然会犯这种失误。\n不知怎么的，连我也有种收到了礼物的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "0e46cbf4c47772f603f42d258ef0b0012e0ea70113b071fdae0536a3148a2e50", "ja": "付き合っていただいて、ありがとうございました。\nでも、本番はここからです。", "zh": "谢谢您愿意陪我一起。  \n不过，正式演出现在才要开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1021_p", "source_sha256": "17f8be5812bf0e0a71b779e1caefdc0740da149a32d367f9dbca6ef19cad4bed", "ja": "本番？　他に行きたいところでもあるのか？", "zh": "正式演出？难道还有想去的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "dcc5d1e31fbe00436b86d9cf590719e7902ce13761a0c1f1b06c3cabcc0f7111", "ja": "はい。実は、外の広場でクリスマスの催しをやっている\nんです。今から見に行ってみませんか？", "zh": "是的。其实，外面的广场正在举办圣诞活动。现在要不要一起去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1023_p", "source_sha256": "63a7f2770e7809f7069341a268ef2ce22a369421fb74822da8b1f0e3ec72bf41", "ja": "もうそんな季節か……。よし、行ってみよう！\n今日はどこへでも付き合うよ。", "zh": "已经到这个季节了啊……好，去看看吧！\n今天无论去哪儿我都陪你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0354_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0354_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "d6b84ef93df7476c6a2294a6735bbabecdd7f79f76d123a878d704b27f1b7eee", "ja": "はい。何やらビックリなサプライズもあるそうです。\n楽しみですね、{$P$}。ふふっ。", "zh": "好的。听说还有个令人惊讶的惊喜呢。\n真让人期待，{$P$}先生。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
